**Count = 1 candidates.** These are $M \in \{99s_0,\; 99s_0+1,\; 101s_0-1,\; 101s_0\}$ (from $|d| \in \{s_0-1, s_0\}$).

**Finding the largest $M$.** I check which candidates fall in the feasible range for each $s_0$:

